§ `B. The basic amounts of the child allowance (BA-01 to BA-22); reading: a fall in the index leaves the amount unchanged`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

rdFall MEANS `the readings` `the readings this row takes` `with` `a fall in the index, in the updating clause of the basic amount` `read as` `a fall in the index leaves the basic amount unchanged`

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The basic amounts of section 1 paragraph (2), computed by the updating clause`
`my basic amounts of` y MEANS `s 1 — the basic amounts of the child allowance on 1 January of` y `, reading` rdFall

