§ `D. Retirement age, Schedule A1 Parts A, B, C, E (RA-01 to RA-68)`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

GIVEN m IS A NUMBER
      y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 1 retirement age in months of a man born in month` m `of` y MEANS
    `s 1 — the retirement age in months of` (`an Israeli employee` "M" `born` (YMD y m 15) `who is` `male`)

GIVEN m IS A NUMBER
      y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 1 retirement age in months of a woman born in month` m `of` y MEANS
    `s 1 — the retirement age in months of` (`an Israeli employee` "W" `born` (YMD y m 15) `who is` `female`)

