§ `E. Residence, s 2A (RS-01 to RS-20)`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

GIVEN permission IS A `The permission under which a person stays in Israel`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`my resident under` permission `on` d MEANS `s 2A — an Israeli resident:` (`a man living in Israel under` permission) `on` d

-- RS-01 to RS-06: the stays that exclude without condition.
#ASSERT NOT `my resident under` `unlawful presence within section 13 of the Entry to Israel Law` `on` (YMD 2026 10 9)
#ASSERT NOT `my resident under` `a permit under the Entry to Israel Order (exemption of residents of Judea and Samaria, the Gaza Strip and northern Sinai, central Sinai, the Sharm el-Sheikh area and the Golan Heights), 5728-1968` `on` (YMD 2026 10 9)
#ASSERT NOT `my resident under` `a visitor's visa and licence of type B/1, B/2, B/3 or B/4, under regulation 5 of the Entry Regulations` `on` (YMD 2026 10 9)
#ASSERT NOT `my resident under` `a visa and licence under regulation 5A of the Entry Regulations` `on` (YMD 2026 10 9)
#ASSERT NOT `my resident under` `a temporary-residence visa and licence of type A/3 (regulation 6(c)), or of type A/4 as a relative of the holder of A/3 (regulation 6(d)), of the Entry Regulations` `on` (YMD 2026 10 9)
-- RS-15, RS-16 (as read: a B visitor who lives in Israel is still within (b)(3)): the same B/2 case lasting 400 days a year is not a resident.
#ASSERT `my resident under` `no permission that section 2A names` `on` (YMD 2026 10 9)

-- RS-14: the determining year of a visa granted on 15 March 2026 begins 13 September 2025 and ends 12 September 2026.
#ASSERT `s 2A — the first day of the determining year of a visa granted on` (YMD 2026 3 15) EQUALS (YMD 2025 9 13)
#ASSERT `s 2A — the day` (YMD 2025 9 13) `falls in the determining year of a visa granted on` (YMD 2026 3 15)
#ASSERT `s 2A — the day` (YMD 2026 9 12) `falls in the determining year of a visa granted on` (YMD 2026 3 15)
#ASSERT NOT `s 2A — the day` (YMD 2026 9 13) `falls in the determining year of a visa granted on` (YMD 2026 3 15)
#ASSERT NOT `s 2A — the day` (YMD 2025 9 12) `falls in the determining year of a visa granted on` (YMD 2026 3 15)
-- RS-07: A/1 granted 1 June 2026, 150 days lived lawfully: not a resident in the determining year (30 Nov 2025 to 29 Nov 2026).
#ASSERT `s 2A — the first day of the determining year of a visa granted on` (YMD 2026 6 1) EQUALS (YMD 2025 11 30)
#ASSERT NOT `my resident under` (`an A/1 visa granted on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `with` 150 `days, section 2A(d) decision:` FALSE) `on` (YMD 2026 10 9)
#ASSERT NOT `my resident under` (`an A/1 visa granted on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `with` 150 `days, section 2A(d) decision:` FALSE) `on` (YMD 2026 5 31)
#ASSERT `my resident under` (`an A/1 visa granted on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `with` 150 `days, section 2A(d) decision:` FALSE) `on` (YMD 2026 11 30)
