§ `F. Who is insured: Chapters 5, 6, 7 (s 158, s 6B), 8, 9, 10, 11 (ST-01 to ST-81)`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

GIVEN p IS A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`my Chapter 5 for` p `on` d MEANS `s 75 — insured under Chapter 5:` p `on` d `, reading` `the readings this row takes`
GIVEN p IS A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`my Chapter 6 for` p `on` d MEANS `s 150 — insured under Chapter 6:` p `on` d `, reading` `the readings this row takes`
GIVEN p IS A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`my Chapter 7 for` p `on` d MEANS `s 158 and s 6B — insured under Chapter 7:` p `on` d `, reading` `the readings this row takes`
GIVEN p IS A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`my section 158(1) for` p `on` d MEANS `s 158 — insured under paragraph (1) of the definition of insured:` p `on` d `, reading` `the readings this row takes`
GIVEN p IS A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`my Chapter 8 for` p `on` d MEANS `s 180-181 — a worker insured under Chapter 8:` p `on` d `, reading` `the readings this row takes`
GIVEN p IS A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`my Chapter 9 for` p `on` d MEANS `s 195 — insured under Chapter 9:` p `on` d `, reading` `the readings this row takes`
GIVEN p IS A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`my Chapter 10 for` p `on` d MEANS `s 223 — insured for long-term care:` p `on` d `, reading` `the readings this row takes`
GIVEN p IS A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`my Chapter 11 for` p `on` d MEANS `s 240 — insured under Chapter 11:` p `on` d `, reading` `the readings this row takes`

-- A man or woman who does not work, resident since the day given (the first residence day) and born on the day given.
GIVEN dob IS A DATE
      first IS A DATE
GIVETH A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
`my man not working, born` dob `resident since` first MEANS `a person` "M" `born` dob `who is` `male` `with` (`a resident since` first) `and` `the work of a person who does not work`
GIVEN dob IS A DATE
      first IS A DATE
GIVETH A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
`my woman not working, born` dob `resident since` first MEANS `a person` "W" `born` dob `who is` `female` `with` (`a resident since` first) `and` `the work of a person who does not work`
GIVEN dob IS A DATE
GIVETH A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
`my woman employee, born` dob MEANS `an Israeli employee` "W" `born` dob `who is` `female`
GIVEN dob IS A DATE
GIVETH A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
`my man employee, born` dob MEANS `an Israeli employee` "M" `born` dob `who is` `male`

