-- ST-37, ST-38 are decided: an immigrant under the Law of Return is insured for long-term care through (4) WITHOUT an absorption basket
-- (the clause "שניתן לו סל קליטה" qualifies the visa holder, the second limb). The encoding requires the basket for both limbs; the two assertions above FAIL on that
