-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
§ `G. s 238: housewife, widow (HW-01 to HW-20)`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

GIVEN s IS A `Marital status`
      a IS A BOOLEAN
      b IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A woman's marriage`
`my marriage:` s `, traces vanished:` a `, abroad against her will:` b MEANS
    `A woman's marriage` WITH
        `marital status` IS s
        `her spouse's traces have vanished for two years` IS a
        `her spouse has been abroad for two years without her consent and has not supported her in that time` IS b

myMarried MEANS `my marriage:` `married` `, traces vanished:` FALSE `, abroad against her will:` FALSE
mySpouse MEANS `an Israeli employee` "Husband" `born` (YMD 1985 1 1) `who is` `male`
myWife MEANS `a person` "Wife" `born` (YMD 1988 1 1) `who is` `female` `with` (`a resident since` (YMD 1988 1 1)) `and` `the work of a person who does not work`
myDay MEANS YMD 2026 10 9

-- HW-01: a married woman, spouse insured under Chapter 11, not working: a housewife.
#ASSERT `s 238 — a housewife:` myWife `, her marriage` myMarried `, her spouse` (JUST mySpouse) `, on` myDay
-- HW-02, HW-03: she works, or is self-employed.
#ASSERT NOT `s 238 — a housewife:` (myWife `with the work` `the work of an employee in Israel`) `, her marriage` myMarried `, her spouse` (JUST mySpouse) `, on` myDay
#ASSERT NOT `s 238 — a housewife:` (myWife `with the work` `the work of a self-employed person in Israel`) `, her marriage` myMarried `, her spouse` (JUST mySpouse) `, on` myDay
-- HW-04: an agunah (traces vanished two years).
#ASSERT NOT `s 238 — a housewife:` myWife `, her marriage` (`my marriage:` `married` `, traces vanished:` TRUE `, abroad against her will:` FALSE) `, her spouse` (JUST mySpouse) `, on` myDay
-- HW-09: an agunah by being abroad against her will.
#ASSERT NOT `s 238 — a housewife:` myWife `, her marriage` (`my marriage:` `married` `, traces vanished:` FALSE `, abroad against her will:` TRUE) `, her spouse` (JUST mySpouse) `, on` myDay
-- HW-05: the spouse is not insured under Chapter 11 (a man born 15 Jan 1950 who first became resident at 63).
#ASSERT NOT `s 238 — a housewife:` myWife `, her marriage` myMarried `, her spouse` (JUST (`my man not working, born` (YMD 1950 1 15) `resident since` (YMD 2013 5 1))) `, on` myDay
-- HW-06: an unmarried woman.
