-- Widows. A woman born 1985 (age 40 at the death in 2026) and a woman born 1970 (55 at the death in 2026-02).
GIVEN married IS A DATE
      death   IS A DATE
      child   IS A BOOLEAN
      sep     IS A BOOLEAN
      entitled IS A BOOLEAN
      borne   IS A BOOLEAN
      supp    IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A widowing`
`my widowing: married` married `, died` death `, child` child `, separated` sep `, entitled` entitled `, bore` borne `, supplement` supp MEANS
    `A widowing` WITH
        `she was his wife at his death` IS TRUE
        `the day of the marriage` IS married
        `the day of his death` IS death
        `she bore him a child` IS child
        `in the five years before his death she was separated from him for three years or more, including the twelve months before his death` IS sep
        `she was entitled to maintenance from him by a judgment or a written agreement` IS entitled
        `he did in fact bear her maintenance in the twelve months before his death` IS borne
        `a dependants' supplement was paid for her at his death under section 200 or 244` IS supp

w40 MEANS `a person` "W40" `born` (YMD 1985 1 1) `who is` `female` `with` (`a resident since` (YMD 1985 1 1)) `and` `the work of a person who does not work`
w55 MEANS `a person` "W55" `born` (YMD 1970 1 1) `who is` `female` `with` (`a resident since` (YMD 1970 1 1)) `and` `the work of a person who does not work`
w54 MEANS `a person` "W54" `born` (YMD 1971 6 1) `who is` `female` `with` (`a resident since` (YMD 1971 6 1)) `and` `the work of a person who does not work`
rdNow MEANS `the readings this row takes`

