#ASSERT `s 69 — the person to whom the child allowance is paid, in` (`my section 69 facts: parents` `a mother only` `, with the father only` FALSE `, father entitled` FALSE `, asked` FALSE `, guardian` FALSE `, appointee` FALSE) EQUALS `the mother`
