#ASSERT `s 69 — the person to whom the child allowance is paid, in` (`my section 69 facts: parents` `no parent` `, with the father only` FALSE `, father entitled` FALSE `, asked` FALSE `, guardian` FALSE `, appointee` TRUE) EQUALS `the person appointed under section 304(a)`
-- CH-30: (d), the welfare of the child, a decision of the Institute.
