-- s 69A. A child: name, date of birth, mother, whether the mother proved the no-joint-household facts.
GIVEN n IS A STRING
      d IS A DATE
      m IS A STRING
      p IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A child of a man with children by several women`
`my child` n `born` d `of` m `, mother proved:` p MEANS
    `A child of a man with children by several women` WITH
        `name` IS n
        `date of birth` IS d
        `the name of the child's mother` IS m
        `the mother proved to the Institute's satisfaction that she keeps no joint household with the father and that the child does not depend on his table` IS p

