caseCH32 MEANS LIST `my child` "a1" `born` (YMD 2010 1 1) `of` "A" `, mother proved:` FALSE,
                    `my child` "a2" `born` (YMD 2012 1 1) `of` "A" `, mother proved:` FALSE,
                    `my child` "b1" `born` (YMD 2015 1 1) `of` "B" `, mother proved:` FALSE
