#ASSERT `s 69A — the count in which` (`my child` "b1" `born` (YMD 2015 1 1) `of` "B" `, mother proved:` FALSE) `comes, among` caseCH32 EQUALS `the count of the father`
-- CH-33: A proves she keeps no joint household: A's children go to A's count; B's child stays in the father's.
