caseCH34 MEANS LIST `my child` "a1" `born` (YMD 1998 1 1) `of` "A" `, mother proved:` FALSE,
                    `my child` "a2" `born` (YMD 1999 1 1) `of` "A" `, mother proved:` FALSE,
                    `my child` "a3" `born` (YMD 2000 1 1) `of` "A" `, mother proved:` FALSE,
                    `my child` "a4" `born` (YMD 2002 1 1) `of` "A" `, mother proved:` FALSE,
                    `my child` "b1" `born` (YMD 2015 1 1) `of` "B" `, mother proved:` FALSE
#ASSERT `s 69A — the count in which` (`my child` "a4" `born` (YMD 2002 1 1) `of` "A" `, mother proved:` FALSE) `comes, among` caseCH34 EQUALS `the count of its mother`
#ASSERT `s 69A — the count in which` (`my child` "b1" `born` (YMD 2015 1 1) `of` "B" `, mother proved:` FALSE) `comes, among` caseCH34 EQUALS `the count of its mother`

-- s 71. fatherFirst, second parent's name, entitled, also gone, the day the second went, with the mother only.
GIVEN fatherFirst IS A BOOLEAN
      second      IS A MAYBE STRING
      entitled    IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The facts of section 71`
`my section 71 facts: first is the father` fatherFirst `, second parent` second `, second entitled` entitled MEANS
    `The facts of section 71` WITH
        `the name of the parent who died or ceased to be insured` IS "First"
        `that parent is the child's father` IS fatherFirst
        `the day he or she died or ceased to be insured` IS YMD 2020 1 1
        `the name of the child's second parent` IS second
        `the second parent is entitled to the child allowance` IS entitled
        `the second parent also died or ceased to be insured` IS FALSE
        `the day the second parent died or ceased to be insured` IS NOTHING
        `the child is with the mother only` IS FALSE
