-- CH-38, CH-40: the second parent is not entitled: by virtue of the parent who died or ceased to be insured.
#ASSERT `s 71 — by virtue of whom, one parent having died or ceased to be insured, in` (`my section 71 facts: first is the father` TRUE `, second parent` (JUST "Mother") `, second entitled` FALSE) EQUALS `by virtue of the parent who died or ceased to be insured`
-- No second parent at all.
#ASSERT `s 71 — by virtue of whom, one parent having died or ceased to be insured, in` (`my section 71 facts: first is the father` TRUE `, second parent` NOTHING `, second entitled` FALSE) EQUALS `by virtue of the parent who died or ceased to be insured`

