-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
§ `K. Income Support Law gates (IS-01 to IS-26)`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

GIVEN grounds IS A LIST OF `A ground of entitlement under section 2(a) of the Income Support Law`
      res24   IS A BOOLEAN
      pension IS A BOOLEAN
      inst    IS A BOOLEAN
      army    IS A BOOLEAN
      corp    IS A BOOLEAN
      terror  IS A BOOLEAN
      abroad  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The facts of a claimant under the Income Support Law`
`my ISL facts: grounds` grounds `, 24 months` res24 `, pension` pension `, institution` inst `, army` army `, corporation` corp `, terror` terror `, abroad all month` abroad MEANS
    `The facts of a claimant under the Income Support Law` WITH
        `grounds under section 2(a)(1), (2), (3), (5), (7), (8) and (9) that hold` IS grounds
        `a ground of the First Schedule under section 2(a)(2A) holds` IS FALSE
        `a resident of Israel in the Area within section 378 of the Insurance Law` IS FALSE
        `was a resident of Israel for the 24 consecutive months before the claim` IS res24
        `receives a pension under Chapter 5 or Chapter 11 of the Insurance Law` IS pension
        `is in an institution maintained wholly at the expense of the State or another named body, section 3(1)` IS inst
        `serves regular service in the Israel Defense Forces, or is the wife of one who does, section 3(2)` IS army
        `is a member of a corporation responsible for the livelihood of its members, section 3(3)` IS corp
        `is a student at an institution the Minister fixed, and not within the exceptions of section 3(4)(a) and (b)` IS FALSE
        `is barred by section 3C (a conviction for a terror offence)` IS terror
        `stayed outside Israel on every day of the month, section 14A(a)` IS abroad

GIVEN b IS A NUMBER
      i IS A NUMBER
      ds IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      claim IS A DATE
GIVETH A `The money of a month under the Income Support Law`
`my money: without income` b `, my income` i `, my determining sum` ds `, my claim month` claim MEANS
    `The money of a month under the Income Support Law` WITH
        `the benefit for a person without income, from the Second Schedule` IS b
        `the income, computed under sections 9 to 12` IS i
        `the determining sum that applies to the claimant under section 7(a), if regulations fix one` IS ds
        `the first day of the month in which the claim was submitted` IS claim

myUnfit MEANS LIST `unable to work and earn a living, or not placeable in any work, as determined under regulations, section 2(a)(1)`
myNone MEANS EMPTY
myF MEANS `my ISL facts: grounds` myUnfit `, 24 months` TRUE `, pension` FALSE `, institution` FALSE `, army` FALSE `, corporation` FALSE `, terror` FALSE `, abroad all month` FALSE
GIVEN dob IS A DATE
GIVETH A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
`my claimant born` dob MEANS `a person` "C" `born` dob `who is` `male` `with` (`a resident since` dob) `and` `the work of a person who does not work`
GIVEN dob IS A DATE
GIVETH A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
`my woman claimant born` dob MEANS `a person` "C" `born` dob `who is` `female` `with` (`a resident since` dob) `and` `the work of a person who does not work`

