-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
§ `L. Maintenance (Assurance of Payment) Law gates (ML-01 to ML-20)`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

GIVEN judgment IS A BOOLEAN
      lives    IS A BOOLEAN
      onDay    IS A BOOLEAN
      months24 IS A BOOLEAN
      enforcing IS A BOOLEAN
      from     IS A DATE
      request  IS A DATE
      rate     IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `The facts of a maintenance creditor`
`my creditor facts: judgment` judgment `, lives with debtor` lives `, debtor resident on the day` onDay `, debtor 24 of 48 months` months24 `, enforcing` enforcing `, from` from `, request` request `, rate` rate MEANS
    `The facts of a maintenance creditor` WITH
        `a maintenance judgment was given in the person's favour` IS judgment
        `a maintenance judgment was given in favour of the person's minor child in the person's keeping` IS FALSE
        `lives with the debtor` IS lives
        `a resident of Israel in the Area within section 378 of the Insurance Law` IS FALSE
        `the debtor was an Israeli resident on the day of the judgment` IS onDay
        `the debtor was an Israeli resident for at least 24 of the 48 months before the day of the judgment` IS months24
        `is pursuing enforcement proceedings on the judgment` IS enforcing
        `the Minister of Justice's regulations let payment continue despite enforcement, section 9(d)` IS FALSE
        `the day from which the judgment orders maintenance` IS from
        `the day to which the judgment orders maintenance, if it names one` IS NOTHING
        `the day the request for payment was submitted to the Institute` IS request
        `the monthly maintenance the judgment orders` IS 2000
        `the monthly rate the regulations fix, if they are given` IS rate

myCred MEANS `my creditor facts: judgment` TRUE `, lives with debtor` FALSE `, debtor resident on the day` TRUE `, debtor 24 of 48 months` FALSE `, enforcing` FALSE `, from` (YMD 2025 1 1) `, request` (YMD 2026 10 9) `, rate` NOTHING
myCreditor MEANS `a person` "Creditor" `born` (YMD 1985 1 1) `who is` `female` `with` (`a resident since` (YMD 1985 1 1)) `and` `the work of a person who does not work`

-- ML-01: resident creditor, debtor resident on the judgment day: entitled.
#ASSERT `ML s 2 — entitled to ask for a monthly payment:` myCreditor `with` myCred `, on` myDay `, reading` rdNow
-- ML-02, ML-03: debtor not resident on the day but 24 of the 48 months: entitled; neither: not.
#ASSERT `ML s 2 — entitled to ask for a monthly payment:` myCreditor `with` (`my creditor facts: judgment` TRUE `, lives with debtor` FALSE `, debtor resident on the day` FALSE `, debtor 24 of 48 months` TRUE `, enforcing` FALSE `, from` (YMD 2025 1 1) `, request` (YMD 2026 10 9) `, rate` NOTHING) `, on` myDay `, reading` rdNow
#ASSERT NOT `ML s 2 — entitled to ask for a monthly payment:` myCreditor `with` (`my creditor facts: judgment` TRUE `, lives with debtor` FALSE `, debtor resident on the day` FALSE `, debtor 24 of 48 months` FALSE `, enforcing` FALSE `, from` (YMD 2025 1 1) `, request` (YMD 2026 10 9) `, rate` NOTHING) `, on` myDay `, reading` rdNow
-- ML-04: a creditor who is not a resident.
#ASSERT NOT `ML s 2 — entitled to ask for a monthly payment:` (`a person` "Abroad" `born` (YMD 1985 1 1) `who is` `female` `with` `a person living abroad` `and` `the work of a person who does not work`) `with` myCred `, on` myDay `, reading` rdNow
-- ML-05: a creditor who lives with the debtor.
#ASSERT NOT `ML s 1 — a creditor:` (`my creditor facts: judgment` TRUE `, lives with debtor` TRUE `, debtor resident on the day` TRUE `, debtor 24 of 48 months` FALSE `, enforcing` FALSE `, from` (YMD 2025 1 1) `, request` (YMD 2026 10 9) `, rate` NOTHING)
-- ML-08: the rate needs the regulations: refused.
#ASSERT REFUSED `ML s 3 — the monthly payment rate:` myCred
-- ML-09: request 9 Oct 2026, judgment from 1 Jan 2025: from 9 Oct 2025 (one year before the request, the later). ML-10: judgment from 1 March 2026: from 1 March 2026.
#ASSERT `ML s 6(a) — the first day payment can be made for:` myCred EQUALS (YMD 2025 10 9)
#ASSERT `ML s 6(a) — the first day payment can be made for:` (`my creditor facts: judgment` TRUE `, lives with debtor` FALSE `, debtor resident on the day` TRUE `, debtor 24 of 48 months` FALSE `, enforcing` FALSE `, from` (YMD 2026 3 1) `, request` (YMD 2026 10 9) `, rate` NOTHING) EQUALS (YMD 2026 3 1)
-- ML-12: enforcement after applying (the creditor is pursuing it): barred.
#ASSERT `ML s 9 — barred by pursuing enforcement:` (`my creditor facts: judgment` TRUE `, lives with debtor` FALSE `, debtor resident on the day` TRUE `, debtor 24 of 48 months` FALSE `, enforcing` TRUE `, from` (YMD 2025 1 1) `, request` (YMD 2026 10 9) `, rate` NOTHING)
#ASSERT NOT `ML s 9 — barred by pursuing enforcement:` myCred

-- s 9A. departures in the calendar year up to the month; the month has a departure after the third / a return after the third / only days abroad; days abroad in the year; days in the month; exempt; treated as outside.
GIVEN deps IS A NUMBER
      flag IS A BOOLEAN
      yd IS A NUMBER
      md IS A NUMBER
      ex IS A BOOLEAN
      out IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The absences of a maintenance creditor in a month`
`my absences: departures` deps `, month has a late departure or return or only days abroad` flag `, days in the year` yd `, days in the month` md `, exempt` ex `, treated as outside` out MEANS
    `The absences of a maintenance creditor in a month` WITH
        `departures from Israel in the calendar year, up to and including the month` IS deps
        `the month contains a departure after the third, a return after the third, or only days abroad` IS flag
        `days abroad in the calendar year, up to the end of the month` IS yd
        `days abroad in the month` IS md
        `exempt under section 9A(c)` IS ex
        `treated as outside Israel under section 9A(d)` IS out

-- ML-14: the fourth exit in the year: the exit month is not paid.
#ASSERT `ML s 9A — not paid for the month because of absence abroad:` (`my absences: departures` 4 `, month has a late departure or return or only days abroad` TRUE `, days in the year` 30 `, days in the month` 10 `, exempt` FALSE `, treated as outside` FALSE)
-- ML-15: fewer than four exits, 80 days abroad in the year, the cumulative 72 passed in this month: not paid.
#ASSERT `ML s 9A — not paid for the month because of absence abroad:` (`my absences: departures` 2 `, month has a late departure or return or only days abroad` FALSE `, days in the year` 80 `, days in the month` 30 `, exempt` FALSE `, treated as outside` FALSE)
-- Fewer than four exits and 60 days abroad: paid.
#ASSERT NOT `ML s 9A — not paid for the month because of absence abroad:` (`my absences: departures` 2 `, month has a late departure or return or only days abroad` FALSE `, days in the year` 60 `, days in the month` 20 `, exempt` FALSE `, treated as outside` FALSE)
-- ML-16: treated as outside Israel under 9A(d) (183 days in 12 months): not paid.
#ASSERT `ML s 9A — not paid for the month because of absence abroad:` (`my absences: departures` 1 `, month has a late departure or return or only days abroad` FALSE `, days in the year` 200 `, days in the month` 30 `, exempt` FALSE `, treated as outside` TRUE)
-- ML-18: exempt (medical treatment, employer-required trip): the exit rules do not apply.
#ASSERT NOT `ML s 9A — not paid for the month because of absence abroad:` (`my absences: departures` 4 `, month has a late departure or return or only days abroad` TRUE `, days in the year` 30 `, days in the month` 10 `, exempt` TRUE `, treated as outside` FALSE)

